Before moving forward, I want to formally close Goal.

The review is complete and I consider the architecture locked.

Please stop producing patches, diffs, changelogs, review notes, maintenance notes, and amendment bundles.

Instead, perform a full merge and generate the complete finalized Goal specification as a single consolidated artifact.

Requirements:

- Apply every approved change from the review.
- Resolve all numbering.
- Resolve all cross-references.
- Remove superseded clauses.
- Remove deprecated wording.
- Incorporate all accepted amendments directly into the text.
- Do not output patches.
- Do not output diffs.
- Do not output commentary.
- Do not output rationale.
- Do not output maintenance notes.

Output only:

<goal vFinal>
...
</goal>

This should be the exact version that would be committed if Goal were entering production today.

Once that artifact is produced, I will treat Goal as closed and move on to Perfection.
